        value += .70
    return (document, raw), float(value)

"""Approximate a lexical sincerity/manners feature, including split words.

Respond to honesty, frankness, humility, kindness and Chinese sincerity or
promise forms. Boost 'kind' after copulas, degree words and possessives.
A short buffer joins word pieces and handles literal escaped newlines.
Unmatched text gets zero; rare names and other lexical aliases are omitted.
